<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AutoZone raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AutoZone raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James said Wednesday it had raised its rating for AutoZone Inc to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company were up 1/4 to 23-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
